<overview>
<p>Conventional infantry within the FWLM serve as the backbone of provincial defense across a patchwork of semi-autonomous states, each maintaining its own military traditions and equipment preferences. Deploying crew-served Thumper artillery pieces, these platoons provide indirect fire support at the battalion and regimental level, lobbing high-explosive rounds onto targets beyond direct line of sight. The Thumper is the lightest tube artillery in common service, valued for its mobility relative to heavier systems.</p>
</overview>

<notes>
Intro date based on prototype release of FWL advanced infantry kit
</notes>

